# Local durable paper stores. data/paper/ holds only generated runtime state: the
# manual paper ledger, the automated prospective evidence and health stores, and their
# locks and staging files. None of it is source, configuration or governance. It must
# stay untracked: the observer writes its own health store inside the repository, so a
# tracked runtime file would make the observer dirty its own tree and invalidate its
# own build provenance the moment it activates.
data/paper/PAPER_TRADES_V2.json
data/paper/FUTURE_SHADOW_PAPER_EVIDENCE_V1.json
data/paper/FUTURE_SHADOW_PAPER_EVIDENCE_V1_1.json
data/paper/PROSPECTIVE_SHADOW_OBSERVER_HEALTH_V1.json
data/paper/PROSPECTIVE_SHADOW_OBSERVER_HEALTH_V1_1.json
data/paper/*.lock
data/paper/*.staging
data/paper/*.lease
